{"synopsis":"Kiper… Dengan tinggi 168cm?! Baek Seungwon dikeluarkan dari timnya akibat tinggi badannya yang dinilai kurang cocok untuk mengisi posisi kiper. Setelah itu, Baek Seungwon bersumpah bahwa dia tidak akan bermain sepak bola lagi. Tapi takdirnya berubah setelah dia bertemu dengan tim futsal yang bernama ‘Goranese’. Akankah Seungwon akan bisa tumbuh bersama dengan Goranese?!","alternative_title":"골레이로","author":"Yinan","artist":"Chaekie","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"87ff41f3-f05c-40bf-9870-176de3f7c934","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"522f5763-d447-4357-a1dc-8eadffd82b2c","number":"66","chapter":"66","title":"","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"85ea2a9b-6b44-44b4-b081-7816689ac1da","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"","date":"2026-07-05","released":"2026-07-05"},{"chapter_id":"b0edbacf-6849-4199-a4d3-d5414887656f","number":"64","chapter":"64","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"77c3606d-b44c-410a-ac81-02584732c239","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"20707477-5e7b-4d06-90d3-9b23403a576d","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29"},{"chapter_id":"9c1ac797-b376-4a19-b14a-c36c55c62aed","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2026-06-28","released":"2026-06-28"},{"chapter_id":"29b78e8a-7e6d-4b11-9ee8-0e13e9cee706","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"00a90f63-c270-4c3b-8a28-3170b35009d5","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"bcd352c2-72f5-452d-a8e6-7a5660101594","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25"},{"chapter_id":"b7857002-05f0-4017-80ca-bfe65b9f49f7","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23"},{"chapter_id":"1750b